 "_notes": [
  "Combo: Fire (Blazing Muscles/Billowing Maw...), Sword, Ambrosia — classes mirror the BP icons: Fire = Fire/Flamethrower weapons, Sword = Sword/Slabsword, Ambrosia = Ambrosia/Primordial. Interpretation.",
  "Burn: +1 Danger per Metal Gear equipped; discard Flammable Gear (interpretation: one Flammable card, chosen by the player) if caused by a Primordial Attack; Danger from Burn is dealt at the end of the Attack.",
  "Sheet BU1051 transcribed (front Lv I / back Lv II-IX). 2x2 footprint, rear = Blindspots, Danger Zone = 4 side-adjacent spaces (D).",
  "Nietzschean Beginning of the End: after End of Hope, draw another AI card then perform Combo (even if a Combo was already resolved).",
  "God Among Men (Lv IX): the Nietzschean acts after 2 Titan turns — implemented as a mid-Titan-Round Primordial Round after the 2nd Titan turn.",
  "Zone patterns and Weakspots read cell-by-cell from the AI cards ([depth, lateral]; depth 0 = front body column, -1 = back body column; lateral half-lanes, + = Nietzschean's right). Dust Zone = diamond |depth|+|lateral| <= N from the body centre; World of Black Blast Zone = distance >= 8."
 ],
