 "traits": {
  "Stay Your Hand": "Each Nietzschean Attack deals 1 Danger less.",
  "Danger Sense": "The D letters on the Primordial Diagram mark the Danger Zone spaces. If a Titan moves through the Danger Zone during the Titan Round, roll a d10. On 7+, they manage to get through. Otherwise, they immediately stop and the Nietzschean performs Signature against that Titan. Ignore this Trait during a Nietzschean Attack.",
  "End of Hope": "End of Primordial Round: Perform Signature.",
  "The Strong Eat": "Additional Setup: Add 1 You died! Obol to the Obol deck.",
  "Weapon Master": "Additional Setup: Place a Combo token on the Sword space of the Combo track (Sword → Fire → Ambrosia). After resolving a Combo or Combo Break, move the token clockwise. After resolving the first AI card in a Round, perform ⚡ Combo: draw and resolve another AI card. Combo Break: a Titan who is not the Priority Target and has a Weapon of the class on the Combo track may exhaust it (within its effective range) to break the Combo; they gain the PT token. Inevitable: with 6+ Wounds Sword combos cannot be broken; with 10+ Wounds Fire combos cannot be broken. Rage gain does not trigger PT change.",
  "Shadow and the Flame": "Attacks that don't normally deal Ambrosia deal 1 Ambrosia token.",
  "All For One": "There is a flaw in the Nietzschean's technique! Ignore Danger Sense when moving into the Weakspot. The Weakspot is the space marked in a different colour on the top card of the AI discard pile. When on a Weakspot space, you may perform a normal Attack without drawing a BP card: Power Roll, halve Total Power (round up), +1 if Crit Chance, note it, clear the Kratos Pool and continue to the second ability window. The next Titan Attack adds the noted Power to its Total Power.",
  "Ticking Clock": "Disable the Stay Your Hand Trait. End of Primordial Round: Titan with the lowest Danger gains X Danger, X = current position of the Time marker (Round number here).",
  "Flawless": "Disable the All For One Trait.",
  "Dealbreaker Stance": "Use the alternate Combo track instead of the regular one: Sword (Knife, Shield) → Fire (Spear, Sword, Cestus) → Ambrosia (Club, Axe) → Hatred (Whip, Bow, Slabsword).",
  "Fate of All Cowards": "When a Titan voluntarily moves away from the Nietzschean, the Nietzschean immediately performs Signature against that Titan.",
  "Beginning of the End": "End of Primordial Round: After End of Hope, draw another AI card. After resolving this card perform Combo, even if you already resolved a Combo this Round.",
  "No Missed Chances": "When a Titan performs a Full Evade or reduces all Danger from an Attack to 0, perform Signature.",
  "No Quarter": "If a Titan has to resolve an Obol Draw, they die instead.",
  "Ruthless": "Remove all positive Trauma cards from the Trauma decks (except Obols).",
  "God Among Men": "The Nietzschean performs his Round after 2 Titan turns. Then the other 2 Titans go, then the Nietzschean, then the players can re-arrange their playing order."
 },
